---
// Buttondown redirects here after the confirmation link is clicked
// (Settings: subscription confirmation redirect URL).
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="You're signed up" description="Your email signup for FedCourtsAI release updates is confirmed." noindex>
  <h1>You're signed up</h1>
  <p>
    You'll get an email from <code>updates@fedcourts.ai</code> when there's a new release, which is about two to four
    times a year, and the weekly Supreme Court update if you ticked that box. Every email has an unsubscribe link and a
    link to your preferences, where you can change which updates you get.
  </p>
  <p>
    In the meantime, the <a href="/">board</a> shows what the models are calling now, and the <a href="/results">results page</a>
    is where scored releases are published.
  </p>
</Base>
